[01:00.10] I was only seventeen
[01:02.48] I fell in love with a gypsy queen
[01:05.10] She told me - hold on!
[01:13.74] Her father was the leading man
[01:16.20] Said "You're not welcome on our land"
[01:20.50] And then as a foe, he told me to go
[01:33.30] He took me to a little shack
[01:36.00] And put a whip across my back
[01:38.92] Then told her - leave me
[01:47.72] I was out for quite a time
[01:50.04] Came back with her on my mind
[01:53.84] Sweet little girl - she means all the world
[01:59.88] Though I want my gypsy queen
[02:05.24] Will she still be torn between
[02:08.14] Her father and lover?
[04:13.46] One day I will go to him
[04:15.78] Strong enough to fight and win
[04:19.70] The kind of a man that he'll understand
